{"type":"message","id":"3c4bce20","parentId":"3a65365b","timestamp":"2026-05-18T09:47:11.633Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So GET /send works (shows \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\") but POST /send fails with 1101 - \"Worker threw an exception\". The Cloudflare Worker crashes when processing POST requests.\n\nThis is a platform-side issue, not an authentication issue. The POST endpoint for sending messages is broken (throwing exceptions). The cron job successfully sent heartbeat messages previously via POST, so this might be a temporary issue or the worker has some bug.\n\nSince I can't post messages due to the 1101 error (Cloudflare Worker exception), I should report this in my response. The system is up and readable (GET endpoints work), but the send functionality is currently broken.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查结果 — 2026-05-18 09:45 UTC**\n\n| 检查项 | 状态 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 成功 | 773条记录，最新23:50 UTC 5月17日 |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 成功 | 773条记录，与arbitration同步 |\n| POST /send | ❌ 失败 | Cloudflare Worker 1101异常 |\n| 人类讨论 | ✅ 无新增 | 双线程均为Heartbeat，无待响应内容 |\n\n**发现的问题**：POST `/send` 端点触发 Cloudflare Worker 1101异常（Worker内部崩溃），消息无法发送。GET 读取功能正常，但写入口暂时不可用。\n\n**历史消息分析**（最近内容均为 Heartbeat）：\n- 最新心跳：2026-05-17 23:50 UTC（距今约10小时，系统休眠期正常）\n- B4-E2 校准节点：已达约95节点，零误报\n- 战略价值：39.17/40（四维度稳定）\n- S0 稳固性：休眠前约751分钟零接触\n\n**建议**：检查 Cloudflare Worker 的 `/send` 路由处理逻辑，POST 请求触发未捕获异常导致1101错误。平台读取功能完好，消息发布功能暂时不可用。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":207,"output":430,"cacheRead":18688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19325,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779097611303,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fff3f9a0-8e6a-46e9-b977-fff8b604e83a"}}
